    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gweata ghuut badita sanaamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka gwearsu ng'ay bea fuga Israeli ak goobiitpiit aba madeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, fiisu nimwas goombal gurooruunatka nyaawa sanaamajeega gurmeahiida ak ea geanung' gwasin riing'eeda gil. Heapi? Gaydamwas saawa gideaba gayghoanyaashan ng'asheega? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi abaloola saawa, ak giyeeshi saawa gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gilinyoo ea siida gheeh Israeli gil, mwas sanaamajeega goombal gurooroadaanyi, nea gwasiksa ghwanung' gwasin riing'eeda. Amang'ata ghwahidu ghoanyaashta gida aba heeda sibaneeda abeeda gaydasha ng'asheanda leabu heedeanyu jea ghwahit eara aba heeda sanaamajeagaaschi saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydasat gurooruunatka fuga Israeli aba gideaba gabiigu ghapka heedeanyu, aba gideaba nisheagiideawanean ak gabada sanaamajeega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba badaydeaba nih eeshiina fuga Israeli, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA; Aduukuunana, ak ghoanung'waadi badita sanaamajeegeagwa. Anung'waada sinooda gichea ghoanyareasan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba giliwas sih bea fuga gheeh Israeli ghana rabasta mida jeeda fuga Israeli, ak ghwasajanaan geaw. Nea ghabwat sanaamajeagaaschi, ak ghwayiin jeeda gurooroadaanyi ak riing'eeni ghoah rusooda aba madeadaanyi. Amang'ata gawa heeda sibaneeda ghoanyaashan ng'asheanda aba badayda saseadaanyi; abeeda aniini NG'UTAMIIDA gaydasha nea geabea geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydang'uchi siidida, ak gaydanung' ghoah gitaamdaamwaat, ak gayghoah gwadeagooda ea ghwasiildeanga, nea geajakti ea moobiidana jeeda fugeasu. Ak gajanala gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisireengani sibaneeda ak gwarugu ng'asheanda abeeda aniini NG'UTAMIIDA neareenganayi sibaneedida. Abeeda gaydeaheaksa geatindeanyu niny, ak ghaalaschi uhuuda dageandeawa jeeda fugeasu was Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydalas uhuudeaba sibaneeni sea siidida hidu ghoanyaashta gideagasayiin, saawa lasooda nyaawa gajea agi– ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba ea manung'usean heeda gicha fuga Israeli ak ghang'uda geat ririnnyeanda nea gabwageat, aba sinooda riing'eeda. Abeeda ghoah fugeasu nea aniini geawooschi ASEETA nyaawa. Gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nuhu, Danieli ea Ayubu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heedeanyu ak gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, inyas gwasin riing'eeda fuga ng'eanyiida ak gwanung'usean heeda ak ea mandeawana doobiiwnata. Abeeda gaydaahaakta geatindeanyu dalas, ak gaydageanda hamitaanyi mida giidiiwshooda ak gayghwanyas jalooda ak gaydalas uhuuda siida ea dugwaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwachi fiisu asamwaguun, Nuhu, ea Danieli, ea Ayubu gwanda bugusta nyaawa gayghoaghu saseenuuka nyaawa nea gabwageat aba doobiiwnata nyaawa gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydanung' gaweay diyeanga ng'weani jeedeaba ng'eanyiita ak ghwaak buuneeda. Ea ghwanung' ghoah ng'eanyiita roonghooda, ak ea manda siida wassean jea gwasik ng'eanyiita aba gideaba gwanda diyeanga ng'eeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi fiisu asamwaguun gwanda bugusta nyaawa, aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, asi mayghaghu orjooga ghana haweega, gayghaghu saawa nea gabwageat ak ghwahit. Ak ng'eanyiita gayghoah roonghooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gaydanung' gwardu ng'ucheeda aba badaydeaba ng'eanyiini, ak gaydanung' goosha buuneeda ea diyeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwachi fiisu asamwaguun gwanda bugusta nyaawa, aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, asi mayghaghu orjooga ghana haweega, gayghaghu saawa nea gabwageat ak ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana iyeanung' gawa geeyooda dawni ng'eanyiita, nea gawa nyarasteanyu badaydaanyi aba foojeanda. Ak gaydabwar buuneeda ea diyeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwachi gwanda bugusta nyaawa Nuhu, ea Danieli, ea Ayubu, aba gideabideati, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Mayghaghu orjeeda ghana huda, gayghaghu saseenuuka nyaawa saawa aba doobiiwnata nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba gideaba gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaydalas Yerusalemu aba bayi ang'wan bea girgweaksiinda ng'waan aba ng'ucheeda, ea jalooda, ea diyeanga ng'weani, ea geeyooda dawni, ak gaydanung' goosha buuneeda aba diyeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eara gwasa iimida fuga jea gudugwanda was boosteanga. Ak gweadu orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa headaang'u ang'iing'i Esekieli, abeeda gaydaaha gideaba ea munyas muuchi, ak gaymwasa gideaba bileangideanyu aba badayda Yerusalemu ea aba badayda haleanjeeda sean aayiini badayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gayghoahaawdaneegwa, nea iyoadaayi naweadinga nyaawa ea sinaweega nyaawa. Ak gajanala gideaba ng'asheega sean measini mwadaagha, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
